@startuml Loan_State_Machine

title Loan State Machine (from Loan.java, LoanOfficer.java, Bank.java)

[*] --> PENDING : customer.requestLoanForAccount()\n[new Loan, status = "PENDING"]

PENDING --> APPROVED : bank.reviewLoan(approve = true)\n-> LoanOfficer.review()\n[verifyCustomer() is true]\n/ loan.approve()

PENDING --> REJECTED : bank.reviewLoan(approve = false)\n-> LoanOfficer.review()\n/ loan.reject()

PENDING --> REJECTED : bank.reviewLoan(approve = true)\n[verifyCustomer() is false]\n/ loan.reject()

APPROVED --> CLOSED : repay loan fully\n(PLANNED)

REJECTED --> [*]
CLOSED --> [*]

note right of PENDING
  verifyCustomer() passes when:
  - customer has at least 1 account
  - total balance >= 500
  Only a LoanOfficer can review
  (Bank.requireRole check).
end note

note bottom of APPROVED
  Calling review() on a loan that is
  not PENDING throws IllegalStateException,
  so APPROVED and REJECTED are final
  for review purposes.
end note

@enduml
